NEVE sounding head - firmware revisions

NV-4.2.1   2026-08-14
  * Sessions: OPEN hands out a session token and every request names one. Each session
    has its own table, round counter, output and budget.
  * A checkpoint needs 4096 of budget left.
  * The head port also accepts a WebSocket upgrade: one JSON request per message. JSON
    lines are unchanged.

NV-4.1.0   2026-05-02
  * Request pacing per head.
  * Idle connections close after 5 minutes.

NV-4.0.0   2026-03-19
  * Field firmware for the SHARD-24 units.
  * No bench model for 4.x. neve_bench.py stays at NV-3.4.2.

NV-3.4.2   2025-11-07
  * HELLO reports the last output bit.
  * SOUND takes up to 4096 symbols per request.

NV-3.4.0   2025-09-22
  * Budget per head. A wrong CHECKPOINT costs 4096.
  * Recovery bundle sealed with HKDF-SHA256 and AES-256-GCM.

NV-3.3.0   2025-07-15
  * Rows chained: a row opens when the row before it is confirmed.
  * Confirmed rows stay open for sounding.

NV-3.2.0   2025-06-02
  * Keystream draws keyed per head; 32-bit thresholds.
  * Grades fixed at eight steps, 0.18 to 0.82.
